UID:019dd521-b4f4-a7ee-5873-dcf85008501d@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, August 26\, 2026 at 2:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy M
 useum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 34m\n\n2010 | 94 min. | Japan | Co
 lor | Japanese with English subtitles| Rated G | DCP \nDIRECTED BY: Hiroma
 sa Yonebayashi \nWRITTEN BY: Hayao Miyazaki\, Keiko Niwa \nWITH: Mirai S
 hida\, Ryunosuke Kamiki\, Tatsuya Fujiwara\, Tomokazu Miura\n\nType: Scree
 nings\n\nDebut director Hiromasa Yonebayashi (When Marnie Was There\, 2014
 ) and Studio Ghibli teamed up for this film version of Mary Norton’s 195
 2 children’s classic The Borrowers\, full of gorgeous imagery of the nat
 ural world. Arrietty is the daughter of a family of Borrowers—miniature 
 people secretly living in an occupied house—who risk their home when she
  befriends a human boy.
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/the-secret-world-of-a
 rrietty-019dd521-b4f4-a7ee-5873-dcf85008501d
